# Text files are stored with LF and checked out with the platform's line
# ends, except where a program reads them on Linux or in a container: a
# shell script checked out with CRLF (Windows Git's core.autocrlf=true)
# fails to start ("#!/bin/sh\r": No such file or directory).
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
